        "collapsible_text_yWJc7i": {
          "type": "collapsible_text",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "icon_width": 20,
            "title": "💡 Engraving ideas",
            "content": "<p><strong>Couple's initials (A+B, A ♡ B)</strong><br/>Engrave your love on each heart with meaningful initials: A + B or A ♡ B, a simple yet powerful declaration.<br/><br/><strong>Names (Julie / David)</strong><br/>A precise engraving for a declaration of love that stands the test of time.<br/><br/><strong>Special date (05/01/2014)</strong><br/>The memorable date of your choice is carefully engraved, turning each heart into a time capsule of your most precious memories.<br/><br/><strong>Roman numerals (V.XVI.MMXX)</strong><br/>Elevate your story with the sophistication of Roman numerals: V.XVI.MMXX, adding a classic touch to your personalized jewelry.<br/><br/><strong>Romantic quotes:</strong><br/>- Forever / and always<br/>- You & Me / Forever<br/>- I love you / Always<br/><br/>Each quote is an engraved promise that captures the eternity of your feelings. Choose the ones that resonate most with your story.<br/><br/><strong>Symbols (♥❤♡✿❀✽★✯☆☘☾∞)</strong><br/><br/>Express the inexpressible with symbols: heart, star, flower or infinity, adding a layer of emotion to your jewelry.<br/>⚠️ Please choose from the symbols listed above to avoid errors with our engraving tools.</p><p>⚠️ The longer the text you want engraved, the harder it can be to keep the engraving clearly visible. By choosing a short engraving, you make sure every letter stays clear and legible on your jewelry.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
